      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Token refresh**\n\n- Official endpoint: GET graph.instagram.com/refresh_access_token?grant_type=ig_refresh_token\n- Due: updated_at missing or age >= 50 days\n- No IG username/password needed - it only uses the existing long-lived token in IG_Accounts\n- On failure the row stays untouched; add your notification node after 'Refresh Failed (check output)'\n- An expired token cannot be refreshed -> generate a new token in Meta for Developers and paste it into IG_Accounts manually",
        "height": 260,
